/.gradle/

# Operating-system metadata
.DS_Store
.DS_Store?
._*
.Spotlight-V100
.Trashes
ehthumbs.db
Thumbs.db
Desktop.ini

# Keep Assets, Packages (including packages-lock.json), and ProjectSettings in Git.
# Never ignore .meta files: Unity needs their GUIDs to preserve asset references.
